OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal cigarettes and tobacco
OL,4,Ashop closed down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop that was repeatedly caught
OL,7,Fselling illegal tobacco and cigarettes
OL,8,Fhas been closed down.
OL,10,FThe Golden Vape shop in Newport,
OL,11,FShropshire, was visited three times
OL,12,Fover a 12-month period by Telford and
OL,13,FWrekin Council, and the local authority
OL,14,Fsaid 4,120 cigarettes and 3.1kg of
OL,15,Ftobacco had been removed.
OL,17,FNone of the products had been subject
OL,18,Fto the payment of tax or duty, it
OL,19,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
